## PB-Compiler specifics
build/
*.EXE
*.PBU
*.PBL
UNITTEST.LOG
dosbox*.conf

# Raw oracle binaries stay out of the repo (proprietary); only the AES-encrypted
# toolchain tarballs are tracked, decrypted into tools/<dialect>/ at run time with
# PB_TOOLCHAIN_KEY. One glob covers every slot - naming them individually only ever
# went stale, and the emulator and download scratch directories live here too.
tools/*/
!tools/*-toolchain.tar.enc
